s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p015","quote":"廣子三人，曰當戸、椒、敢，爲郎。天子與韓嫣戲，嫣少不遜，當戸擊嫣，嫣走。於是天子以爲勇。當戸早死，拜椒爲代郡太守，皆先廣死。當戸有遺腹子名陵。廣死軍時，敢從驃騎將軍。廣死明年，李蔡以丞相坐侵孝景園壖地，當下吏治，蔡亦自殺，不對獄，國除。李敢以校尉從驃騎將軍擊胡左賢王，力戰，奪左賢王鼓旗，斬首多，賜爵關內侯，食邑二百戸，代廣爲郎中令。頃之，怨大將軍青之恨其父，乃擊傷大將軍，大將軍匿諱之。居無何，敢從上雍，至甘泉宮獵。驃騎將軍去病與青有親，射殺敢。去病時方貴幸，上諱云鹿觸殺之。居歳餘，去病死。而敢有女爲太子中人，愛幸，敢男禹有寵於太子，然好利，李氏陵遲衰微矣。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"廣子三人，曰當戸、椒、敢","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"依明示子女及遺腹子記父親，不補母親、出生年或排行；列舉次序不是出生序號。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-shiji109-jiao","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp_C","event_type":"death","status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p015","quote":"當戸早死，拜椒爲代郡太守，皆先廣死。","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0050"}],"interpretation_note":"保存明示死亡及相對時序，不據此終止全部官爵；未明數字紀年保持未知。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"椒","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp_C","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang"},{"id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:m015-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"椒","kind":"person","person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp_C","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p015","chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji109-006","subject_person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp_C","predicate":"father","object_person_id":"27j_f4p_jwp","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang","source_id":"s-shiji-109-liguang","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-109-liguang:p015","quote":"廣子三人，曰當戸、椒、敢，爲郎。天子與韓嫣戲，嫣少不遜，當戸擊嫣，嫣走。於是天子以爲勇。當戸早死，拜椒爲代郡太守，皆先廣死。當戸有遺腹子名陵。廣死軍時，敢從驃騎將軍。廣死明年